/**
 * opencode per-model banner plugin.
 *
 * Renders model-specific ASCII art in place of the default opencode wordmark
 * on the home screen, and a compact banner above the prompt in sessions.
 * Art fallback chain: exact model → model family glob → provider → default.
 *
 * Works in the terminal and the opencode desktop app — both run this same TUI.
 *
 * Home screen: overrides the `home_logo` slot (mode="replace").
 * Session: overrides `session_prompt` slot, wrapping the stock Prompt with a
 * compact single-line banner above it that swaps live on model switch.
 */
