// with vertical gradient palettes). Hand-typed art replaced by generated art;
// figlet() name-art is the fallback for unknown models.
// Generated by /tmp/artgen — DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
// Per-brand smooth gradient half-block art (official brand logos,
// supersampled + density-packed). Data model: runs+colors.

